WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.837
Unit ten. Contraception Basics!

2
00:00:04.779 --> 00:00:09.597
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:12.645
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.695 --> 00:00:16.986
Today we learn about Contraception Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.132 --> 00:00:22.382
Contraception. Say it with me. Contraception!

6
00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:29.443
Condom. Say it with me. Condom!

7
00:00:32.936 --> 00:00:36.386
Pill. Say it with me. Pill!

8
00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:43.650
Implant. Say it with me. Implant!

9
00:00:47.144 --> 00:00:51.744
STI protection. Say it with me. STI protection!

10
00:00:55.268 --> 00:00:59.485
Effectiveness. Say it with me. Effectiveness!

11
00:01:02.948 --> 00:01:07.048
Health worker. Say it with me. Health worker!

12
00:01:10.565 --> 00:01:15.465
Responsibility. Say it with me. Responsibility!

13
00:01:18.962 --> 00:01:32.664
Contraception prevents pregnancy. Methods include the condom, the pill, and the implant, with different effectiveness. Only condoms also give STI protection. A health worker can explain options responsibly.

14
00:01:32.714 --> 00:01:35.887
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:36.792 --> 00:01:41.921
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.971 --> 00:01:43.121
Pill!

17
00:01:43.907 --> 00:01:49.367
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:50.788
Health worker!

19
00:01:51.681 --> 00:01:57.259
Did you know? Condoms are the only contraception method that also helps protect against STIs!

20
00:01:57.309 --> 00:01:59.376
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:10.107
Think and answer. Which contraception method also protects against STIs?

22
00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:11.364
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:17.670
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:20.464
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

